        },
        {
          "text": " Ku baaherize kugyenda, abo batsigazi baaruga omu iziba, baagyenda, baagambira Daudi ebi batumirwe; baamugira bati: Mwimukye, murahukye kwambuka omugyera, ahakuba Ahisofeeli aine enaama eti n'eti y'okubarwanisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
