              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atyo Daudi yaimuka n'abantu abu yaabaire aine boona, baayambuka Yorudani; omushekye ku gwagiire kujuguta, haashangwa hatakiine n'omwe otakambukire.",
          "type": "text",
